H = 1/4*a1^2*k^2 - a0*k*p3 + p1^2 + p3^2 - 1/2*a3*j(t) + 1/2*a0*rho(t)
d/dt p0 = chi = k*p3 - 1/2*rho(t)    (Gauss: 2k p3 = rho)
d/dt chi = 1/2*k*j(t) - 1/2*diff(rho(t), t)   -> vanishes iff rho' = k j, the continuity equation for these modes
d rho/dt + div J = -(k*j(t) - diff(rho(t), t))*sin(k*zz)
